# needs. build.py turns this into each place's inventory.md, refs/, stand-in/ and prompts.json.
#
# Row fields:
#   id, kind, what (plain words), box (x0, y0, x1, y1 in the full-size painting), shared ('made' = made here, 'listed' = a
#   shared id whose stand-in and prompt are made elsewhere, False = this place's own), where_note (optional, added to the
#   inventory's shared column), src (optional: another painting the box is in, for the sky rows)
#   std: how the stand-in is made (ground and material rows that are made here):
#        ('crop', box, squash) or ('montage', rows, row_h, squash, mirror_rows, colour_sigma) ; optional 'even' colour sigma
#   prompt: dict with title, subject, use (and optional shape / rules) for rows that get a ChatGPT prompt
#   ref: optional box for the reference crop, if it differs from box

